  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid Quantum Attention Deep Q‑Network (QADQN) using a 4‑qubit variational quantum circuit within a reinforcement learning trading agent for S&P 500 data. In backtests, QADQN achieves 78.91% return (Sharpe 0.82, Sortino 1.19) on an overlapping test period and 71.26% return (Sharpe 0.77, Sortino 1.28) on a non‑overlapping period, outperforming Buy‑and‑Hold (74.42% / 44.22%) and DDPG (31.23% / 15.94%). However, experiments appear to rely on simulated quantum circuits and provide no evidence of computational quantum advantage.",
